SUMMARY:Game Night @ Neighbors Cafe
DESCRIPTION:Meet People Lancaster\nFriday\, May 15th is board game night a
 t Neighbors Cafe & afterparty at Decades Lancaster!\n\nNeighbors Cafe has 
 several board games there but please bring your favorite game along to sha
 re!\n\nGame Night @📍Neighbors Cafe: 6:30PM-8PM\n\nAfterparty @📍Decad
 es : 8:15PM-10:00PM (but you can stay later if the party is still going st
 rong)\n\nCost: Free to attend\, but please support Neighbors with a drink 
 purchase as a thanks for hosting us and please tip your barista. Please ti
 p your bartender @ Decades and make sure you settle your tab there before 
 leaving for the night.\n\nmeet people Lancaster • Lancaster things to do
  • Lancaster events • neighbors cafe • decades Lancaster
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meet-people-lancaster/events/31455010
